---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-masa-levadura" set:html={`<section class="hero"><div class="heroin"><div><div class="crumb">Cocina / Masa y levadura</div><div class="eyebrow">Pan, pizza y fermentación</div><h1>La cantidad justa de levadura para el tiempo que tenés</h1><p class="lead">Elegí qué vas a preparar, cuánta harina usás y cuándo querés hornear. Te damos una receta completa y un plan de fermentación, no un número suelto.</p><div class="pills"><span>Levadura seca o fresca</span><span>Temperatura ambiente</span><span>Hidratación explicada</span></div></div><div class="bowl-scene" aria-label="Bowl con masa fermentando"><div class="board"></div><div class="bowl"><div class="dough"></div></div><i class="flour-dust d1"></i><i class="flour-dust d2"></i><i class="flour-dust d3"></i><div class="tag"><small>Tu masa estará lista en</small><strong id="heroTime">8 horas</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="calculator"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="kicker">Empezá por la situación</div><h2>¿Qué masa querés hacer?</h2></div><p>Cada caso carga una hidratación y un tiempo razonables, pero todo queda editable.</p></div>
<div class="cases"><button class="case active" data-case="pizza"><i>🍕</i><strong>Pizza para hoy</strong><small>Fermentación a temperatura ambiente.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="cold"><i>❄</i><strong>Pizza de 24–48 h</strong><small>Menos levadura, más sabor.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="bread"><i>▰</i><strong>Pan casero</strong><small>Miga tierna y levado en el día.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="starter"><i>◉</i><strong>Masa madre</strong><small>Usá tu cultivo activo.</small></button></div>
<div class="workspace"><div class="panel form"><h3>Armá tu preparación</h3><p class="sub" id="caseCopy">Pizza flexible, lista para hornear esta noche.</p><div class="fields">
<div class="field"><label for="flour">Harina <output id="flourOut">1.000 g</output></label><input id="flour" type="range" min="250" max="3000" step="50" value="1000"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="balls">Piezas o panes</label><input id="balls" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="4"><small>Divide la masa total en partes iguales.</small></div>
<div class="field"><label for="hydration">Hidratación <output id="hydrationOut">65%</output></label><input id="hydration" type="range" min="50" max="80" step="1" value="65"><small>Más hidratación: masa más aireada y pegajosa.</small></div>
<div class="field"><label for="salt">Sal <output id="saltOut">2,5%</output></label><input id="salt" type="range" min="1.5" max="3" step=".1" value="2.5"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="temperature">Temperatura ambiente</label><input id="temperature" type="number" min="10" max="35" value="22"><small>En una cocina más cálida fermenta antes.</small></div>
<div class="field"><label for="hours">Tiempo disponible</label><select id="hours"><option value="2">2 horas</option><option value="4">4 horas</option><option value="8" selected>8 horas</option><option value="12">12 horas</option><option value="24">24 horas</option><option value="48">48 horas</option></select></div>
<div class="field full"><label for="yeastType">Qué levadura tenés</label><select id="yeastType"><option value="dry">Seca o instantánea</option><option value="fresh">Fresca</option><option value="starter">Masa madre activa</option></select></div>
</div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Actualizar receta</button><button class="reset" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<aside class="panel recipe" aria-live="polite"><span class="badge" id="badge">Pizza para hoy</span><h3 id="recipeTitle">Tu masa de pizza</h3><div class="serves" id="yield">4 bollos de 426 g</div><div class="ingredients"><div class="ingredient"><small>Harina</small><strong id="rFlour">1.000 g</strong></div><div class="ingredient"><small>Agua</small><strong id="rWater">650 g</strong></div><div class="ingredient"><small>Sal</small><strong id="rSalt">25 g</strong></div><div class="ingredient"><small id="yeastLabel">Levadura seca</small><strong id="rYeast">2,5 g</strong></div></div><div class="timeline"><div class="timeline-head"><span id="stage1">Mezclar y amasar</span><span id="stage2">8 h de fermentación</span></div><div class="track"><span id="progress"></span></div><small id="schedule">Dejá 6 h en bloque, dividí y descansá 2 h antes de hornear.</small></div><div class="tip" id="tip">La masa debe crecer, verse aireada y recuperar lentamente la forma cuando la tocás.</div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="guide"><div class="wrap guide-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Leé la masa</div><h2>El reloj orienta. La masa confirma.</h2><p>La harina, la temperatura real y la fuerza del amasado cambian el tiempo. Estas señales te dicen cuándo avanzar.</p></div><div class="checks"><div class="check"><b>Lista para dividir</b><span>Creció entre 60% y 100%, tiene burbujas y se siente elástica.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Le falta tiempo</b><span>Está tensa, densa y la marca del dedo vuelve enseguida.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Pasada de fermentación</b><span>Se desinfla al tocarla, está muy floja y huele fuerte a alcohol.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Si hace mucho calor</b><span>Usá agua fresca o reducí levadura; no agregues harina para compensar.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Antes de meter las manos en la masa</h2><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuánta levadura fresca equivale a la seca?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Como regla práctica, usá tres veces el peso: 3 g de fresca equivalen aproximadamente a 1 g de seca.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Puedo dejarla más tiempo?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Sí, pero bajá la cantidad de levadura y usá frío para fermentaciones de 24 a 48 horas.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Qué significa 65% de hidratación?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Que por cada 1.000 g de harina usás 650 g de agua. Es una proporción panadera, no un porcentaje del peso final.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-masa-levadura')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-masa-levadura');

(()=>{const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],fmt=n=>Number(n.toFixed(1)).toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:1});let active="pizza";const presets={pizza:{h:65,s:2.5,t:22,time:8,type:"dry",copy:"Pizza flexible, lista para hornear esta noche.",title:"Tu masa de pizza"},cold:{h:68,s:2.7,t:20,time:24,type:"dry",copy:"Fermentación larga: menos levadura y más sabor.",title:"Pizza de fermentación lenta"},bread:{h:62,s:2,t:24,time:4,type:"fresh",copy:"Pan casero tierno, con levado y formado en el día.",title:"Tu pan casero"},starter:{h:72,s:2,t:24,time:12,type:"starter",copy:"Masa madre activa, con fermentación más paciente.",title:"Tu pan de masa madre"}};
function calculate(){const flour=+$("[id=flour]").value,balls=Math.max(1,+$("[id=balls]").value||1),hydration=+$("[id=hydration]").value,saltPct=+$("[id=salt]").value,temp=+$("[id=temperature]").value,hours=+$("[id=hours]").value,type=$("[id=yeastType]").value,water=flour*hydration/100,salt=flour*saltPct/100;let dryPct=Math.max(.03,1.45/(hours*Math.pow(1.08,temp-20)));let yeast=flour*dryPct/100,label="Levadura seca";if(type==="fresh"){yeast*=3;label="Levadura fresca"}if(type==="starter"){yeast=flour*(hours>=12?20:25)/100;label="Masa madre activa"}const total=flour+water+salt+yeast,bulk=Math.max(1,Math.round(hours*.75)),proof=Math.max(1,hours-bulk);$("#flourOut").textContent=fmt(flour)+" g";$("#hydrationOut").textContent=hydration+"%";$("#saltOut").textContent=fmt(saltPct)+"%";$("#rFlour").textContent=fmt(flour)+" g";$("#rWater").textContent=fmt(water)+" g";$("#rSalt").textContent=fmt(salt)+" g";$("#rYeast").textContent=fmt(yeast)+" g";$("#yeastLabel").textContent=label;$("#yield").textContent=balls+" "+(active==="pizza"||active==="cold"?"bollos":"piezas")+" de "+fmt(total/balls)+" g";$("#stage2").textContent=hours+" h de fermentación";$("#schedule").textContent="Dejá "+bulk+" h en bloque, dividí o formá y descansá "+proof+" h antes de hornear.";$("#progress").style.setProperty("--fill",Math.min(92,55+hours/2)+"%");$("#heroTime").textContent=hours+" "+(hours===1?"hora":"horas");$("#tip").textContent=temp>=28?"Con "+temp+" °C la masa irá rápido: controlala antes del horario estimado.":temp<=16?"Con "+temp+" °C la fermentación será lenta; buscá un lugar más templado.":"La masa debe crecer, verse aireada y recuperar lentamente la forma cuando la tocás."}
$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.case;const p=presets[active];$$("[data-case]").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));$("[id=hydration]").value=p.h;$("[id=salt]").value=p.s;$("[id=temperature]").value=p.t;$("[id=hours]").value=p.time;$("[id=yeastType]").value=p.type;$("#caseCopy").textContent=p.copy;$("#recipeTitle").textContent=p.title;$("#badge").textContent=b.querySelector("strong").textContent;calculate()}));$$("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);$("#reset").addEventListener("click",()=>{$("[data-case=pizza]").click();$("[id=flour]").value=1000;$("[id=balls]").value=4;calculate()});$$(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));calculate()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-masa-levadura{--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#2e7499;--ink:#202333;--muted:#686b76;--line:#e4ded2;--flour:#fbf7ed;--cream:#fffaf0;--wheat:#d89b3c;--wheat2:#f2cf86;--sage:#dbe8d7;--green:#37684c}
.mockup-masa-levadura *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-masa-levadura{margin:0;font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fffdfa}.mockup-masa-levadura button,.mockup-masa-levadura input,.mockup-masa-levadura select{font:inherit}.mockup-masa-levadura .head{height:74px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:white}.mockup-masa-levadura .brand{font-weight:900;font-size:19px}.mockup-masa-levadura .brand b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white;margin-right:10px}.mockup-masa-levadura .nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:750;color:#4e5360}.mockup-masa-levadura .search{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:white;padding:10px 15px;color:#555b67}
.mockup-masa-levadura .hero{padding:54px 24px 65px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,#fff2cf 0 18%,transparent 18.2%),linear-gradient(135deg,#fffdf8,#f6efe0)}.mockup-masa-levadura .heroin{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-masa-levadura .crumb{color:var(--blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:850}.mockup-masa-levadura .eyebrow{margin-top:27px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#9a6418;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-masa-levadura .hero h1{font:900 clamp(43px,5vw,68px)/.98 Inter,system-ui;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:690px}.mockup-masa-levadura .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-masa-levadura .pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:24px}.mockup-masa-levadura .pills span{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;padding:8px 12px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px}
.mockup-masa-levadura .bowl-scene{min-height:330px;position:relative}.mockup-masa-levadura .board{position:absolute;inset:40px 5% 5px;border-radius:45% 15% 25% 12%;background:#d2a565;transform:rotate(-3deg);box-shadow:0 28px 50px #7c531f28}.mockup-masa-levadura .bowl{position:absolute;width:330px;height:180px;left:50%;top:110px;transform:translateX(-50%);border-radius:18px 18px 165px 165px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#174b7a,#4283a3 48%,#174b7a);box-shadow:0 25px 30px #40301d34}.mockup-masa-levadura .bowl:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:19px;right:19px;top:-43px;height:88px;border-radius:50%;background:#e9f4f6;border:14px solid var(--blue)}.mockup-masa-levadura .dough{position:absolute;width:260px;height:104px;left:50%;top:54px;transform:translateX(-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 38% 34%,#fff8de 0 3%,transparent 3.5%),radial-gradient(circle at 62% 57%,#dba951 0 3%,transparent 3.5%),linear-gradient(145deg,#f9df9b,#dca84f);box-shadow:inset -18px -14px 25px #b97a2650}.mockup-masa-levadura .flour-dust{position:absolute;background:#fff8df;border-radius:50%;opacity:.8}.mockup-masa-levadura .d1{width:16px;height:8px;left:46px;top:70px}.mockup-masa-levadura .d2{width:26px;height:10px;right:48px;top:41px}.mockup-masa-levadura .d3{width:12px;height:12px;right:15px;bottom:20px}.mockup-masa-levadura .tag{position:absolute;right:4%;top:23px;transform:rotate(5deg);background:white;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #6c4a1b1c}.mockup-masa-levadura .tag small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.mockup-masa-levadura .tag strong{font-size:19px;color:#8b5913}
.mockup-masa-levadura .calculator{padding:65px 24px}.mockup-masa-levadura .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.mockup-masa-levadura .sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:24px}.mockup-masa-levadura .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#9a6418;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-masa-levadura .sectionhead h2,.mockup-masa-levadura .guide h2,.mockup-masa-levadura .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-masa-levadura .sectionhead p{max-width:500px;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-masa-levadura .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-masa-levadura .case{padding:17px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;min-height:112px}.mockup-masa-levadura .case i{font-style:normal;display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff3d7}.mockup-masa-levadura .case strong{display:block;margin:10px 0 3px}.mockup-masa-levadura .case small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-masa-levadura .case.active{border:2px solid var(--wheat);padding:16px;background:#fffbf1;box-shadow:0 10px 24px #9a641815}.mockup-masa-levadura .case.active i{background:var(--wheat);color:white}
.mockup-masa-levadura .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.93fr 1.07fr;gap:20px}.mockup-masa-levadura .panel{border-radius:24px;padding:28px}.mockup-masa-levadura .form{border:1px solid var(--line);background:white;box-shadow:0 16px 40px #483b250c}.mockup-masa-levadura .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-masa-levadura .sub{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-masa-levadura .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:17px}.mockup-masa-levadura .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-masa-levadura .field label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-masa-levadura .field label output{color:#9a6418}.mockup-masa-levadura .field small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}.mockup-masa-levadura input,.mockup-masa-levadura select{width:100%;min-height:49px;border:1px solid #d8d2c8;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;background:white;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-masa-levadura input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:var(--wheat);min-height:28px}.mockup-masa-levadura .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-masa-levadura .primary{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:900;padding:14px;cursor:pointer}.mockup-masa-levadura .reset{border:1px solid var(--wheat);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#74521d;font-weight:850;padding:13px 17px;cursor:pointer}
.mockup-masa-levadura .recipe{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--blue),var(--blue2));color:white;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-masa-levadura .recipe:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:240px;height:240px;border:45px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:50%;right:-115px;bottom:-105px}.mockup-masa-levadura .recipe-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.mockup-masa-levadura .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff0be;color:#704d13;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-masa-levadura .recipe h3{font-size:30px;margin:13px 0 4px}.mockup-masa-levadura .serves{color:#dcecf2;font-size:14px}.mockup-masa-levadura .ingredients{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin:23px 0}.mockup-masa-levadura .ingredient{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:15px;border:1px solid #ffffff2d;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px}.mockup-masa-levadura .ingredient small{display:block;color:#d9e9ef}.mockup-masa-levadura .ingredient strong{font-size:23px}.mockup-masa-levadura .timeline{margin-top:18px;padding:17px;border-radius:15px;background:#ffffff0f;border:1px solid #ffffff25}.mockup-masa-levadura .timeline-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-masa-levadura .track{height:8px;background:#ffffff30;border-radius:10px;margin:12px 0 8px;overflow:hidden}.mockup-masa-levadura .track span{display:block;height:100%;width:var(--fill);background:var(--wheat2);border-radius:10px}.mockup-masa-levadura .tip{margin-top:16px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream);color:#5b4828;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}
.mockup-masa-levadura .guide{padding:70px 24px;background:#f5f4ed}.mockup-masa-levadura .guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:45px}.mockup-masa-levadura .guide p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-masa-levadura .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-masa-levadura .check{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;border-radius:16px}.mockup-masa-levadura .check b{display:block;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-masa-levadura .check span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-masa-levadura .faq{padding:70px 24px}.mockup-masa-levadura .faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-masa-levadura .faq-q{width:100%;border:0;background:none;padding:18px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-align:left;font-weight:850;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.mockup-masa-levadura .faq-a{display:none;padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px}.mockup-masa-levadura .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-masa-levadura .foot{padding:30px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);background:white}
@media(max-width:850px){.mockup-masa-levadura .nav{display:none}.mockup-masa-levadura .heroin,.mockup-masa-levadura .workspace,.mockup-masa-levadura .guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-masa-levadura .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-masa-levadura .bowl-scene{min-height:320px}.mockup-masa-levadura .sectionhead{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:530px){.mockup-masa-levadura .cases,.mockup-masa-levadura .fields,.mockup-masa-levadura .checks,.mockup-masa-levadura .ingredients{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-masa-levadura .hero h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-masa-levadura .bowl{width:285px}.mockup-masa-levadura .actions{flex-direction:column}}

.mockup-masa-levadura { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .top, .mockup-masa-levadura header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-masa-levadura :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-masa-levadura input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-masa-levadura input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-masa-levadura input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-masa-levadura .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-masa-levadura support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
